        <body>
            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0420" n="106" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg106"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/902</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Roumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Vopicka</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-14T12:00:00+01:44">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">September 14, 1914, 12 noon</hi>.</date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received September 18, 2:35 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Upon receipt last night of reports of Russian victories, a popular demonstration
                    hostile to Austria-Hungary and Germany was suppressed by police and military. It
                    appears likely that Roumania will enter into conflict with Russia within a few
                    days.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vopicka</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
